'''Camp Taurajo''' is a [[tauren]] outpost situated in the [[Barrens]] near the mountain pass leading to [[Mulgore]]. It can be reached by starting tauren players by following the road east from [[Bloodhoof Village]]. It has an [[inn]], a few vendors, some [[Professions|profession]] trainers, and a [[flight master]].

==Facilities==
* Stables
* Inn
* Anvil & forge 
* Wind rider
* Equipment repair

